## Computed-results cache

{{#if view.shared}}
- Before computing a value about a specific object, look it up: `bin/cache lookup <key…>`.
- After computing one worth reusing, add it with `bin/cache append cache/results/<table>.tsv …`{{#if modules.experiments}} (or have the driver write `experiments/<slug>/results-catalog.tsv`, which lookups include){{/if}}.
- A second, different value for the same key is a CONFLICT to investigate, never to overwrite.

Rules and format: [docs/discipline/results-cache.md](docs/discipline/results-cache.md).
{{/if}}
